      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Recording (⌘R)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始录音 (⌘R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting the recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Recording (⌘R)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止录音 (⌘R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Audio": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Audio + Microphone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统声音 + 麦克风"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Audio Only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅系统声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统默认（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk couldn’t keep up; about %@ seconds of audio were lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘写入跟不上，丢失了约 %@ 秒音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time you record, macOS asks whether Rotap may record other apps’ audio, and the microphone when you use it. If a recording is silent, allow Rotap in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次录音时，macOS 会询问是否允许 Rotap 录制其他 App 的音频；用到麦克风时也会询问麦克风权限。如果录下来全是静音，请在系统设置里允许 Rotap。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To use a different microphone, pick it from the microphone menu in the toolbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在工具栏的麦克风菜单里可以换用别的麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WAV · 24-bit lossless": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WAV · 24-bit 无损"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for sound…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待声音…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for sound… The waveform appears once something plays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待声音… 开始播放后波形就会出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your voice and what your Mac plays are mixed into one file. Rotap never changes your speaker or headphone output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你说的话和电脑播放的声音会混在同一个文件里。Rotap 不改变你的扬声器或耳机输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
